OL,3,GNEWSABrewhouse Theatre is closing -
OL,4,Awhat happens next?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town's main theatre will close at the
OL,7,Fend of October after operators were
OL,8,Funable to raise enough money to keep it
OL,9,Frunning.
OL,11,FTaunton Brewhouse's closure will leave
OL,12,F23 staff redundant and raises questions
OL,13,Fabout ticket refunds, the future of
OL,14,Ftheatre groups and where this year's
OL,15,Fpantomime could be staged.
OL,17,FLocal councils say discussions are
OL,18,Fcontinuing about the building's future,
OL,19,Fbut there is no timetable for reopening
OL,20,Fthe venue.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
